## CONTEXT7 POLICY (MANDATORY)

For ALL library or framework questions:

Always use Context7 workflow:

1. resolve-library-id
2. query-docs

Libraries requiring Context7 lookup:

* React
* React Hooks
* Vite
* TanStack Query
* shadcn/ui
* react-hook-form
